<title>POLAND: LDA TO INVEST PLN 5.5 MLN IN 1997.</title>
<headline>LDA TO INVEST PLN 5.5 MLN IN 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish printing house Lodzka Drukarnia Akcydensowa SA (LDA) plans to invest 5.5 million zlotys this year, 5.2 million zlotys of it for a new printer, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
